// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Eagle Eye 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P469631177" "Eagle Eye"
// ProfessionString :
"P716367895" "Former member of The Regulators"
// DescriptionString :
"P3512247814" "Eagle Eye is a retired hero who used to be one of the members of The Regulators back in their heyday during the 1980's. After the events in Galaxy City, Eagle Eye has been seeing more and more citizens being corrupted by a growing epidemic of dangerous street drugs like Superadine. While he's not able to join the fight directly, he is more than willing to help up and coming heroes fight the good fight by forming the New Regulators."
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P4141963685" "<color orange>You must become a VIP in order to access this contact.</color>"
// LocationString :
"P1937455418" "Kings Row"
// HelloString :
"P1037903553" "{HeroName}."
// HelloString :
"P2549415085" "We need to chat."
// HelloString :
"P218151071" "A little bird told me something this morning that I think you should hear."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3791111360" "I'm not really sure who you are {Hero.gender=male sir|ma'am}, I'm just here to meet up with some old friends from back in the day."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3644066580" "I've read all about you, {HeroName}, especially with the work you've been doing in taking the fight back to The Skulls and putting down their Superadine operation. I have to say, I'm impressed.<br><br>Back in the day, Brawler along with the rest of the Regulators and I put a stop to all this Superadine business, but it seems that bad apples do indeed stink up the place. As you are well aware, Superadine is back on the streets and The Skulls are pushing it something awful.<br><br>{HeroName}, Kings Row needs a new group of Regulators, and I'm not the only one who thinks you should lead it."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2276891757" "I'm afraid I don't have anything else for you to work on, {HeroName}. However, I'm sure there are plenty of other contacts in the city that would more than happy to have you helping them with their own problems."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1786620812" "I understand that you have a thing for helping everyone who comes to you with a problem, but part of being a leader is knowing what tasks are important and which ones aren't. Come back to me when you are ready to lead the Regulators again."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1096972678" "You've got a lot of potential, but right now if I were to send you against Kings Row's enemies, that potential would get chewed up and spit back out. Best come back to me at Security Level {Level}, then you and I can chat about what good you can do for this city."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P856364347" ""
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2860430557" "Amazing work, my friend, amazing work. With one of the Petrovic brothers behind bars and the other on the run, The Skulls are going to be licking their wounds for some time. Without their Superadine lab or resupply from their backers, Superadine in Kings Row is going to be a think of the past. At least, for now that is."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3741295102" "FailsafeLevel"
// IntroString :
"P2696082218" "A former member of the venerable Regulators, Eagle Eye has come out of retirement to help combat The Skulls and their Superadine dealing in Kings Row."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2349272962" "Meet with Eagle Eye"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P489077056" "You've chosen to meet with Eagle Eye in Kings Row."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


