// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Shauna Stockwell 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1660000026" "Shauna Stockwell"
// ProfessionString :
"P440606746" "Independent journalist"
// DescriptionString :
"P2872243255" "Shauna Stockwell is an independent journalist who hosts an online news site and blog called <i>Raw from the Row</i>. Her journalism has recently trended toward the refugees in Kings Row from Galaxy City and the rise in Superadine use and Skulls influence over her city of Kings Row."
// InteractionRequiresText :
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P3749751176" "Hey, what's up?"
// HelloString :
"P3813971141" "How you doin'?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P767006016" "Busy busy, sorry."
// FirstVisitString :
"P33912801" "Kings Row is in some serious hurt, {HeroName}. Ever since Galaxy City got smushed the refugees have been flocking to Kings Row, hoping that they can return home soon. Unfortunately, a lot of them are out on the street with nowhere to go, and that's made them easy pickings for gangs like <color red>The Skulls</color>.<br><br>I've been keeping tabs on the Skulls for some time with my news site <i>Raw from the Row</i>, and I'm telling you, it looks like we are about to have an epidemic of Superadine addicts if the PPD or someone can't crack down on them. The people of Kings Row need your help."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1856840995" "I don't have any other news stories to follow up on. But I'm sure there are other people in the city that could use your help."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P4127826184" "I can see that you are busy helping other people, {HeroName}. Talk to me once you've cleared your schedule some, I've got a juicy new scoop I'd like you to follow up on."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3518165225" "Whoa there, I can tell you are eager to lend a hand, but Kings Row is no walk in the park. The Skulls don't fool around. Come back when you are Security Level {Level}, then I think those Skulls won't stand a chance against you."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P1949525744" "Have you ever read <i>Raw from the Row</i>? It's an online news site and blog run by Shauna Stockwell. She's been talking lately about how The Skulls have really become a big nuisance in Kings Row lately. You should go talk to her and see if you can lend a hand, I know the PPD could certainly use the help."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P525262275" "Meet with Shauna Stockwell"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3444866870" "You've chosen to work with Shauna Stockwell in Kings Row."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P4170189488" "Hey, I got an e-mail from a guy who claims to be <color blue>Eagle Eye</color> of <color yellow>The Regulators</color> - The Super Group who cracked down on drugs throughout the 1980's. Anyway, he said he wanted to meet you so I told him I'd put you two in contact with each other, if you are interested."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3673397332" "Introduce two contacts"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

